\n  1.0.0-4.0.0. Normative text consumed read-only from\\n  origin/main:internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.6.0.md (sections 6.6, 11.10.2-11.10.5).\\n\\n## Foreign RPC delta (preserved, verified, parked)\\n\\n- All 15 enumerated bytes verified ALL-MATCH against\\n  .temp/TASK-260830-z1yxg9/preserved-before-credentials-260910/manifest.json\\n  before any change; tracked.patch proven byte-identical to `git diff`;\\n  files/ copies verified BACKUP-ALL-MATCH; all modes 100644.\\n- Preservation outcome attached to TASK-260830-z1yxg9\\n  (TASK-260830-z1yxg9_preservation-before-credentials-260910.md) BEFORE\\n  separation, with restoration instructions.\\n- Parked ONLY the enumerated delta: 4 tracked paths restored to checkpoint\\n  blobs (worktree-blob == checkpoint-blob verified per path), 11 untracked\\n  files moved to .temp/TASK-260909-2ez769/parked-rpc-delta-260910/ (bytes\\n  re-verified against manifest). Worktree was CLEAN after parking.\\n- RPC task left pending/blocked; nothing from the delta was consumed.\\n\\n## Base transition (attempted, refused, recorded)\\n\\n- `task-board worktree refresh-candidate TASK-260909-2ez769` refused:\\n  \\\"candidate refresh requires the final unresolved leaf\\\". Exact refusal kept.\\n- No manual rebase/merge/switch performed (Story workspace forbids it).\\n- Implementation therefore sits on checkpoint base c1eff01 (v0.5.0 pin +\\n  checkpointed SSH/peer-identity leaves) while citing v0.6.0 normatively.\\n  Adoption files (specpin v0.6.0, SPEC.v0.6.0.md, catalogue, cigate) were\\n  deliberately NOT duplicated; integration must land this onto the adoption\\n  base. New code references v0.6.0 by value, not by the adopted pin.\\n\\n## What was built\\n\\n- internal/hosttrust (new): TrustStore 1.0.0 closed reader/writer\\n  (exact keys, duplicate-JSON-key audit, uint53 generation, sorted entries,\\n  canonical DER, retire_at exactly-for-retiring); Profile-1 issuance\\n  (fresh P-256 keys, exact CN/SAN/KU/EKU/BC/SKI/AKI/serials/validity,\\n  