r an orphaned local payload, \\\"task-board resource\\nupdate\\\" to replace an existing one, \\\"task-board resource delete\\\" to remove it,\\nand \\\"task-board resource get\\\" to materialize a resource back to the local\\nfilesystem for inspection.\\n\\nUsage:\\n  task-board resource [command]\\n\\nAvailable Commands:\\n  add         Attach a new file resource to an element\\n  adopt       Register an existing unreferenced local resource payload\\n  delete      Delete a resource from an element (requires --confirm)\\n  get         Download a resource to the local filesystem\\n  update      Replace an existing file resource on an element\\n\\nFlags:\\n  -h, --help   help for resource\\n\\nGlobal Flags:\\n      --board-dir string         Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default \\\".task-board\\\")\\n      --context-profile string   Agent context profile override: full or lite\\n      --insecure                 Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)\\n      --json                     Output in JSON format\\n      --no-update-check          Disable automatic update check\\n      --remote string            Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)\\n      --remote-board string      Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)\\n\\nUse \\\"task-board resource [command] --help\\\" for more information about a command.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2055,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 514,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
