{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c711","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa74-c329-7d72-8811-c1901bb53d47"},"sequence":483,"recorded_at":1780531400000961,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"e52fa573-a598-4d15-9493-65cb4f83069f","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"e52fa573-a598-4d15-9493-65cb4f83069f","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"e52fa573-a598-4d15-9493-65cb4f83069f"},"call_id":"call_01a0aa76419a72329b7018fc491821e7","text":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260909-2ez769/TASK-260909-2ez769_exclusion-handoff.md`.\n1|# Host credential exclusion handoff (AC row 21) — from TASK-260909-2ez769\n2|\n3|Producer: TASK-260909-2ez769 (host credentials + Config4 migration), STORY-260830-1kiyj6.\n4|Status: the matcher API below is implemented and tested in this leaf; no\n5|downstream consumer calls it yet. Row 21 is NOT consumer-driven until each\n6|named owner below ships its obligation. This handoff persists the exact\n7|per-surface contract so exclusion cannot be lost between leaves.\n8|\n9|## Producer API (shipped, do not reimplement)\n10|\n11|Package `internal/hosttrust` (`export.go`), tested by\n12|`TestMatchExcludedFromReplication`, `TestExcludedConfigDirName`,\n13|`TestCustodyLayoutFullyExcluded`, `TestEnrollmentExportNotExcluded`,\n14|`TestApplyV4BackupIsClassifiedConfigCopy`:\n15|\n16|- `MatchExcludedFromReplication(relative string) bool` — reports whether a\n17|  STATE_DIR-relative path must stay out of replication, snapshots, cloning,\n18|  Session Directory, logs and exported diagnostic bundles. Covers\n19|  `host-channel/trust.json`, `host-channel/pending-commit.json`,\n20|  `host-channel/credentials/`, `host-channel/lock`, plus transient staging\n21|  files (`.trust-stage-*`, `.custody-stage-*`, `lock-stage-*`). Absolute\n22|  paths and `..` escapes fail closed as excluded.\n23|- `ExcludedConfigDirName(base string) bool` — reports whether a\n24|  configuration-directory file name carries trust-adjacent material:\n25|  `.bak.<version>` backups, `.pre-rollback.<version>` copies,\n26|  `.ax-config-*` staging files.\n27|- `ExcludedFromReplication() []string` — the listed control paths above.\n28|- Explicitly NOT excluded: `ExportEnrollment` material. Explicitly selected\n29|  public bytes (certificate/root, fingerprints) are the only operator\n30|  exchange outside replication; never route private-key.pem, trust\n31|  internals, backups or authorization caches through it.\n32|\n33|## Per-surface obligations\n34|\n35|| # | Surface | Owning task | Must call | Test obligation |\n36||---|---|---|---|---|\n37|| 1 | Directory metadata replication writer | TASK-260830-13bbo0 implement-directory-record-namespace-and-merkle | `MatchExcludedFromReplication` on every record path before write; `ExcludedConfigDirName` for config-dir members | Negative test enumerating every excluded fixture path (trust.json, credentials/&lt;hex&gt;/private-key.pem, pending-commit.json, lock, staging names, .bak./.pre-rollback. names) that FAILS when any is admitted; plus a narrowing variant admitting exactly one excluded member |\n38|| 2 | Metadata disclosure policy | TASK-260830-1ybn3u implement-metadata-disclosure-policies | Encode the exclusion as a deny rule evaluated before any allow rule | Policy test refusing each excluded class and admitting a neighboring allowed path |\n39|| 3 | Clone prepare/stage/publish | TASK-260830-1kj7ae implement-clone-prepare-stage-and-publish | Both matchers at stage enumeration and at publish | Per-phase negative test failing when a custody path is staged or published |\n40|| 4 | Clone bundle member types | TASK-260830-24z2b3 implement-clone-bundle-and-canonical-session-types | Bundle member allowlist must reject excluded paths at construction | Constructor negative test per excluded class |\n41|| 5 | Chunked transfer manifest | TASK-260830-355og8 implement-chunked-transfer-and-resume | Manifest builder drops excluded entries before chunking | Manifest negative test failing when an excluded entry is chunked |\n42|| 6 | Task-board bundle capture/restore | TASK-260830-1ifuz2 implement-task-board-bundle-capture-restore | Capture walker drops excluded paths; restore refuses archives containing them | Negative tests in both directions |\n43|| 7 | Session Directory detail/preview panes | TASK-260830-1b162e implement-detail-preview-jobs-and-provenance-panes | Panes must not resolve, preview or render excluded paths or secret bytes; redact with a static placeholder | Pane test asserting the placeholder (never the bytes) for each excluded path |\n44|| 8 | Diagnostic bundle writer (`ax doctor` export) | UNOWNED — no board task exists (searched 2026-09-16) | When its task is created it MUST consult both matchers and drop matches | Same negative-test shape as row 1 before the surface ships |\n45|\n46|## Acceptance note for reviewers\n47|\n48|Until every row above ships, AC row 21 counts as implemented-matcher-only,\n49|not consumer-driven. This handoff plus the appended notes on the seven owned\n50|tasks are the persisted obligation; the diagnostics surface is explicitly\n51|flagged as unowned rather than waived.","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
